# =============================================================================
# Reeflex — .gitignore
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# INTERNAL ORCHESTRATION / WORKING LAYER — NOT FOR THE PUBLIC REPO
#
# These paths are the local development / working layer (process notes, journals,
# local scaffolding). They are never part of the open-source surface.
# Keep them local; never commit them to the public repository.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
legacy/
.claude/
journal-*.md
code-reports/
BOOTSTRAP.md
wow.md
CLAUDE.md

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/
env/
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
.eggs/
*.egg

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPA binary (downloaded locally, not committed)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
opa
opa.exe

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime audit and probe artifacts
# (keep reeflex-core/audit/.gitkeep so the directory is tracked)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
reeflex-core/audit/*.jsonl
reeflex-core/audit/*.jsonl.lock
reeflex-mock/*.jsonl
*-audit.jsonl
*.log

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets / credentials / certificates
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt
*.cer

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IDE and OS artifacts
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.iml
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Misc test / temp artifacts
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
htmlcov/
.coverage
coverage.xml
*.prof
site/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Per-round agent scratch -- probes, A/B captures, throwaway venvs, policy-pack
# copies, captured core/app/connector output.
#
# RFX-212 measured this class in reeflex-app in August 2026 and fixed it there;
# its own claim recorded that "the MONOREPO was not checked for the same gap".
# Checked 2026-09-23: it has the gap and it is larger. Across all 245 worktrees
# of this repo a `git add -A` would stage 5905 untracked files, of which 1414
# sit under `.scratch*` alone. Excluding throwaway virtualenvs as instrument
# noise, 525 of the remaining files carry a credential-shaped string, and one
# worktree alone accounts for 328 of them.
#
# This is a list, so it is only as wide as the names on it -- a directory named
# outside these prefixes is stageable again. `scripts/tests/
# test_scratch_output_is_ignored.py` pins it and states that limit.
.scratch*/
.rfx*/
.walk*/
.venv-*/
.rig/
.probe*/
.cache/
